spec PushAppleReason.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK AppleRejectionsOnly CapturedMetadata SafeReasons DeliveryIndependent CommitDoesNotWait
check PROPERTIES ReaderDoesNotWrite
reach QueueCanAdvance | one attempt
reach Recognized | one attempt
reach Unknown | one attempt
reach Missing | one attempt
reach Unreadable | one attempt
reach OtherFailure | one attempt
reach LaterReservationKeepsEarlierReason | two attempts
reach TwoReaders | two attempts
run one attempt | Reservations=1 Attempts=1
run two attempts | Reservations=2 Attempts=2
